 </span><span style=\"font-size:12pt;white-space:pre-wrap;\">inputs for HQ</span><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"> </span><span style=\"font-size:12pt;white-space:pre-wrap;\">RnD</span><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"> </span><span style=\"font-size:12pt;white-space:pre-wrap;\">teams for device packaging and assembly. </span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:12pt;white-space:pre-wrap;\"> </span></li></ul><ul style='font-family:\"Basel Grotesk\",Arial,sans-serif;font-size:11pt;font-weight:400;margin:8px 0px;line-height:1.6;padding:0px 0px 0px 32px;list-style-type:disc;'><li style=\"margin:3px 0px;font-size:12pt;line-height:1.6;letter-spacing:0.25px;\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Keep proper documentation, and initiate</span><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"> </span><span style=\"font-size:12pt;white-space:pre-wrap;\">ECN and</span><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"> </span><span style=\"font-size:12pt;white-space:pre-wrap;\">PCN when needed.    </span><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:12pt;white-space:pre-wrap;\"> </span></li></ul><ul style='font-family:\"Basel Grotesk\",Arial,sans-serif;font-size:11pt;font-weight:400;margin:8px 0px;line-height:1.6;padding:0px 0px 0px 32px;list-style-type:disc;'><li style=\"margin:3px 0px;font-size:12pt;line-height:1.6;letter-spacing:0.25px;\"><span style=\"font-size:12pt;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Develop and</span><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"> </span><span style=\"font-size:12pt;white-space:pre-wrap;\">track</span><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"> </span><span style=\"font-size:12pt;white-space:pre-wrap;\">packaging and</span><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"> </span><span style=\"font-size:12pt;white-space:pre-wrap;\">assembly</span><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"> </span><span style=\"font-size:12pt;white-space:pre-wrap;\">component</span><span style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"> </span><span style=\"font-size:12pt;white-space:pre-wrap;\">specifications</sp